{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791101100, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T08:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T08:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791101160, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T08:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 27283, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "30年前就推動營養午餐，沒想到社會運轉了30年，營養午餐反而退步，不需要免費只希望孩子吃好吃飽。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.27,283", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T08:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52830, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "從館前路要到承德路都一定要經過臺北車站，再加上忠孝西路轉進去才兩線到，整個車站四周交通都非常不順暢", "display_name": "大同代表 No.52,830", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T08:05:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47827, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的很多地段的交通號誌，剛亮綠燈起步，不到30公尺-50公尺，下一路口馬上變紅燈，浪費時間跟能源", "display_name": "中正代表 No.47,827", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T08:05:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50423, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北車站大廳到了週末都會聚集很多外勞， 一群群席地而坐， 這情形已好多年， 請問市長對此現象是否有想", "display_name": "中正代表 No.50,423", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 52830, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.52,830", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 47827, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.47,827", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 50423, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.50,423", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 5649